cates a transformation or mapping.  Following the brace are two graphs, eac=
h composed of nodes connected by edges.  The nodes are circles containing t=
he numbers 1 and 2; nodes with the number '2' are highlighted with an orang=
e border. The first graph is a vertical chain of three nodes connected sequ=
entially, with the top and bottom nodes connected to a '2' node each, formi=
